# serv_shell in the emulator's window (ECP5_GUI_SCRIPT; see gui/src/trace.rs).
# SERV executes roughly 30+ clocks per RV32I instruction, so primes 1000 takes
# around 2 million clocks. Typed text waits in the hardware RX FIFO.
# FIRE1 is held for 2 s: the design debounces buttons for 10 ms (250 000 clocks).
0 rate max
0 run
1 board 3d
2 type help\r
10 type primes 1000\r
28 type calc 6*7\r
36 button 1 down   # FIRE1
38 button 1 up
58 quit
